# The reading tools on River.epub: a bookmark, a marked paragraph, the notes
# list that goes back to them, the front light, and the bar kept on screen.
# Marks and bookmarks must still be there after the app restarts, and a
# place that could not be saved is said with a way to try again.
wait-for River
tap River
wait-for Marker 1
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for Page 1 of
tap-id reader-bookmark
wait-for Bookmarked
shot books-bookmarked
tap-id reader-marking
wait-for Tap a paragraph to mark it
tap Marker 2
wait-for Marked: Marker 2
shot books-marking
tap Back to the book
wait-idle
page next
page next
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for Page 3 of
tap-id reader-highlights
wait-for Marked passages
expect Bookmarks
expect Marker 2
shot books-notes
# A mark in the list goes back to its page.
tap Marker 2
wait-idle
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for Page 1 of
tap-id 4294967295
wait-idle
expect-missing Page 1 of
# The light panel, from the bar a tap at the top brings up, moves the
# reader's own front light.
tap-id reader-light
wait-for 20%
tap-id reader-brighter
wait-for 30%
expect-state /device#/frontlightPercent 30
shot books-light
tap-id reader-dimmer
wait-for 20%
expect-state /device#/frontlightPercent 20
tap-id 4294967295
wait-idle
expect-missing 20%
# Show bar keeps the bar over the page while reading, and turns off again.
expect-missing Aa
tap-id reader-controls
tap-id reader-full-page
wait-idle
expect Aa
expect-missing Page 1 of
shot books-bar-kept
tap-id reader-controls
tap-id reader-full-page
wait-idle
expect-missing Aa
# Marks and bookmarks come back after a restart.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Continue reading
restart
wait-for Continue reading
tap Continue reading
wait-for Marker 1
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for Bookmarked
tap-id reader-highlights
wait-for Marked passages
expect Marker 2
expect Bookmarks
tap Back to the book
wait-idle
# With no room to save, closing the book says the place was not saved and
# offers Retry saving, which works once there is room again.
scenario storage-full
page next
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Books could not save your place
expect Retry saving
shot books-place-not-saved
tap Retry saving
wait-for Books could not save your place
scenario normal
tap Retry saving
wait-idle
expect-missing could not save your place
expect Page 2 of
